  "description": "Quantum.Tempo is a powerful, calendar-agnostic .NET library for intuitive and ISO-compliant manipulation of dates, times, intervals, and durations. It supports Gregorian, Persian (Shamsi), Hijri, and custom calendars using a clean, string-based API. Features include recurrence rules (RRULE), interval algebra, duration arithmetic, fuzzy date parsing, time zone support, and a REPL CLI for exploration.",
